674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-MKsPjZqxdUQ7kNvwFBrUSo&_nc_oc=AdpO0u2Y7H2L9Jk4tmFr-PSObosklcHjhYMXYMlm-UJqMU_d5tCnDXUfLE9GPuP5h2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP-CLTvlYPZsyghFBvH7dV-OYZLqNeDNhXkAxOT2hTHmA&oe=6AE0B5D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=blHcwOyP2z4Q7kNvwF83gt2&_nc_oc=Adrt_6SV-8H5n0xt7Wbe1MDm1Lf2-y9lzXduhIwX1Ef8j_qb-vUJ4PVBDx3iwDLIxlk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPl95AzAsrKWM0G6maSI5G8li66_vowR4DT8s2IQBkjHw&oe=6AE0BE96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3U4CUzpfqCIQ7kNvwEspZAJ&_nc_oc=AdoPfhwSsR0cVOZ9ZRigaFHtJewatZfOZtO7DddOiEptqU_C5o62fkLTg7akKffhQws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMIuvLqbRP1CoF_5dhA6HHVHxU6kUvMQumxCa1GOaEggw&oe=6AE0BAB1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip